<title>FINLAND: RISTO MURTO TO JOIN OPSTOCK AS HEAD OF RESEARCH.</title>
<headline>RISTO MURTO TO JOIN OPSTOCK AS HEAD OF RESEARCH.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analyst Risto Murto will join cooperative controlled OKOBANK's brokerage arm Opstock as head of equities research, the banking group said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Murto will move to Opstock from Carnegie Securities Finland where he is currently head of investment research, it said.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the cooperative banking group declined to give a specific date for Murto's transfer but said it would happen &quot;in the near future&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
